  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Header.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"705\"></strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本模组通过使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superoreblock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>SuperOreBlock</strong></span></em></a>引入的新型超级矿石方块，添加了一套升级版武器、工具和盔甲。这些新物品比原版装备略强，能提供自然的强度提升而不会过于破坏平衡。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友联机的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"285\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找能与朋友一起游玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>是您的理想选择！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码\"Lupin\"即可享受25%折扣。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Description.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">特色内容：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">使用<strong>超级铁块</strong>、<strong>超级金块</strong>、<strong>超级钻石块</strong>和<strong>超级下界合金块</strong>打造的全新盔甲套装</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">属性相比常规装备略有提升——设计理念是既有成就感又保持平衡</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">物品通过<strong>锻造台</strong>进行升级：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">将标准物品（如铁胸甲或钻石剑）与对应的超级方块组合即可制作强化版本</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模组非常适合希望在原版友好进度系统中获得额外装备层级的玩家</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Faq.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支持服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！完全兼容！请记住，与朋友畅玩模组的最佳方式就是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>点击此链接可享25%折扣</strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！但仅限于在Modrinth或CurseForge平台发布。上传至其他平台将侵犯我们的权利，这是绝对不允许的</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge整合包，我们将不胜感激。如需任何小调整或有疑问，欢迎联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以录制模组视频并在我的频道展示吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以，您可以在频道中自由游玩本模组或我们的任何整合包并制作相关视频，事实上我们会对此表示非常感谢！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"189\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/280/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/282/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/284/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/285/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
